{"page":185,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:62","surah":8,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن يُرِيدُوٓا۟ أَن يَخْدَعُوكَ فَإِنَّ حَسْبَكَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ هُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَيَّدَكَ بِنَصْرِهِۦ وَبِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they intend to deceive you, God is enough for you: it was He who strengthened you with His help,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُرِيدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they intend","transliteration":"yurīdū","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَخْدَعُوكَ","en_gloss":"deceive you","transliteration":"yakhdaʿūka","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَسْبَكَ","en_gloss":"is sufficient for you","transliteration":"ḥasbaka","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَيَّدَكَ","en_gloss":"supported you","transliteration":"ayyadaka","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِنَصْرِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with His help","transliteration":"binaṣrihi","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَبِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"and with the believers","transliteration":"wabil-mu'minīna","verse_key":"8:62"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٢","en_gloss":"(62)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:62"}]},{"verse_key":"8:63","surah":8,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَلَّفَ بَيْنَ قُلُوبِهِمْ ۚ لَوْ أَنفَقْتَ مَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ جَمِيعًا مَّآ أَلَّفْتَ بَيْنَ قُلُوبِهِمْ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ أَلَّفَ بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and with the believers, and brought their hearts together. Even if you had given away everything in the earth you could not have done this, but God brought them together: God is mighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَلَّفَ","en_gloss":"And He (has) put affection","transliteration":"wa-allafa","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنفَقْتَ","en_gloss":"you (had) spent","transliteration":"anfaqta","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّآ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلَّفْتَ","en_gloss":"(could) you (have) put affection","transliteration":"allafta","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَلَّفَ","en_gloss":"(has) put affection","transliteration":"allafa","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَزِيزٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Mighty","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":20,"ar":"حَكِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"8:63"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٦٣","en_gloss":"(63)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:63"}]},{"verse_key":"8:64","surah":8,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ حَسْبُكَ ٱللَّهُ وَمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Prophet, God is enough for you, and for the believers who follow you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"Prophet","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَسْبُكَ","en_gloss":"Sufficient for you","transliteration":"ḥasbuka","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَنِ","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"wamani","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱتَّبَعَكَ","en_gloss":"follows you","transliteration":"ittabaʿaka","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"8:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:64"}]},{"verse_key":"8:65","surah":8,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ حَرِّضِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَى ٱلْقِتَالِ ۚ إِن يَكُن مِّنكُمْ عِشْرُونَ صَـٰبِرُونَ يَغْلِبُوا۟ مِا۟ئَتَيْنِ ۚ وَإِن يَكُن مِّنكُم مِّا۟ئَةٌ يَغْلِبُوٓا۟ أَلْفًا مِّنَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بِأَنَّهُمْ قَوْمٌ لَّا يَفْقَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Prophet, urge the believers to fight: if there are twenty of you who are steadfast, they will overcome two hundred, and a hundred of you, if steadfast, will overcome a thousand of the disbelievers, for they are people who do not understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"Prophet","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَرِّضِ","en_gloss":"Urge","transliteration":"ḥarriḍi","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْقِتَالِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[the] fight","transliteration":"l-qitāli","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَكُن","en_gloss":"(there) are","transliteration":"yakun","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِشْرُونَ","en_gloss":"twenty","transliteration":"ʿish'rūna","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"صَـٰبِرُونَ","en_gloss":"steadfast","transliteration":"ṣābirūna","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَغْلِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they will overcome","transliteration":"yaghlibū","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِا۟ئَتَيْنِ ۚ","en_gloss":"two hundred","transliteration":"mi-atayni","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَكُن","en_gloss":"(there) are","transliteration":"yakun","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّنكُم","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِّا۟ئَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a hundred","transliteration":"mi-atun","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَغْلِبُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they will overcome","transliteration":"yaghlibū","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَلْفًۭا","en_gloss":"a thousand","transliteration":"alfan","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":22,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":23,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"because they","transliteration":"bi-annahum","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":24,"ar":"قَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a people","transliteration":"qawmun","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":25,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(who do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":26,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"8:65"},{"pos":27,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:65"}]},{"verse_key":"8:66","surah":8,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔـٰنَ خَفَّفَ ٱللَّهُ عَنكُمْ وَعَلِمَ أَنَّ فِيكُمْ ضَعْفًا ۚ فَإِن يَكُن مِّنكُم مِّا۟ئَةٌ صَابِرَةٌ يَغْلِبُوا۟ مِا۟ئَتَيْنِ ۚ وَإِن يَكُن مِّنكُمْ أَلْفٌ يَغْلِبُوٓا۟ أَلْفَيْنِ بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ مَعَ ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But God has lightened your burden for now, knowing that there is weakness in you––a steadfast hundred of you will defeat two hundred and a steadfast thousand of you will defeat two thousand, by God’s permission: God is with the steadfast.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔـٰنَ","en_gloss":"Now","transliteration":"al-āna","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَفَّفَ","en_gloss":"has (been) lightened","transliteration":"khaffafa","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"ʿankum","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَعَلِمَ","en_gloss":"and He knows","transliteration":"waʿalima","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"in you","transliteration":"fīkum","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ضَعْفًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(there) is weakness","transliteration":"ḍaʿfan","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"So if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَكُن","en_gloss":"(there) are","transliteration":"yakun","verse_key":"8:66"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنكُم","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"8:66"},{"p