es the Hereafter [for you]- God is mighty and wise-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِنَبِىٍّ","en_gloss":"for a Prophet","transliteration":"linabiyyin","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَكُونَ","en_gloss":"(there) should be","transliteration":"yakūna","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَسْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"prisoners of war","transliteration":"asrā","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُثْخِنَ","en_gloss":"he has battled strenuously","transliteration":"yuth'khina","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"You desire","transliteration":"turīdūna","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَرَضَ","en_gloss":"(the) commodities","transliteration":"ʿaraḍa","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"but Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"desires","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۗ","en_gloss":"(for you) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَزِيزٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Mighty","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","verse_key":"8:67"},{"pos":20,"ar":"حَكِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"8:67"